==Description==
The '''Snowman Nametag''' is a nametag added as part of the [[Operation I.C.E Event]]. It was originally meant to be obtainable from it, though that never happened, leaving it unused in-game.

The '''Snowman Nametag''' has light blue text surrounded by a translucent dark blue outline. The text is covered in snow, which is melting. There are icicles on the bottom of the nametag. On that snow there is a giant snowman with two stone eyes, a carrot for a nose, black top hat and a red scarf. Snowflakes also appear around the nametag.

